# Core Functionality

The main application logic is handled by `MainActivity.kt`.

## MainActivity

`MainActivity.kt` connects the user interface with the Room Database and manages the main note list.

It handles:

- Loading notes from the database
- Displaying notes in a `RecyclerView`
- Opening the note screen
- Adding new notes
- Updating existing notes
- Searching notes
- Pinning and unpinning notes
- Deleting notes

## NotesTakeActivity

`NotesTakeActivity.kt` is used for creating and editing notes.

The activity receives an existing note when editing and returns the updated note to the main activity.

## Search

The search function filters notes based on the note title or content.

## Note Actions

The application also provides actions for pinning and deleting notes through the note interaction menu.
